  "label": "Colonialism and Music",
  "description": "The role of music in preserving and transmitting the history and experiences of colonized peoples, often in opposition to colonial narratives that sought to erase or distort their histories. The meme critiques the idea of forgetting colonialism by implying that such music is essential for understanding and addressing the legacy of colonialism.",
